  "headline": "Epinephrine is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; the earlier shortage posted 2012-04-27 is resolved",
  "headline_cites": ["D24"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show epinephrine is not on the current shortage list as of 2026-10-21, and the prior shortage first posted 2012-04-27 is resolved.",
      "cites": ["D24"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An import alert 66-66 was published 2009-09-30 for Boehringer Ingelheim Pharma GmbH & Co. KG (FEI 3002806556), 940 days before the 2012-04-27 shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 808119 at that Boehringer Ingelheim plant ended 2012-11-12 and was classified OAI, 199 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued 2013-05-06 to the same Boehringer Ingelheim plant, 374 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 762138 at Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1925262) ended 2012-01-04 classified VAI, 114 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later FDA inspection 1064827 at Hospira ended 2018-08-15 classified OAI, with the OAI classification letter dated 2020-04-22, 2917 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D19"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to buy from Viatris Specialty LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D25"]
    }
  ]
}
